    "changeNote": "Five Kie models listed since 2026-11-05 (docs/model-api-references/{seedream-5-5,gpt-image-2-6,minimax-h3-image,kling-4-0-flash,gemini-omni-1-2-flash}.md, read 2026-11-14): Seedream 5.5 (3.6 / 6.3 credits at 1K / 2K plus 1.44 for every input picture), GPT Image 2.6 (its Economy endpoints, 5 credits a 1K picture; Flare and Sunburst bill tokens and are not offered) and MiniMax H3 Image (1.8 / 1.8 / 5.5 at 1K / 2K / 4K plus 0.5 for every input picture) images; Kling 4.0 Flash (text, a start frame or up to 10 pictures, 720p, 3-20 s, 17 credits/s, audio always on) and Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash (text, a frame pair or up to 6 pictures, 3-15 s with a frame pair at most 10, 4 / 9 / 10 / 22 credits/s at 360p / 720p / 1080p / 4K) videos. Clips are not offered on either video model. Ids confirmed live by zero-cost probes on 2026-11-14.",
